# The READMEs are d2r-metal's own; keep them when merging upstream/main (needs: git config merge.ours.driver true)
# Anchored to the repository root: without the leading slash the rule also matched every README in sub-folders (dm/verify/README.md, ...), which would silently drop upstream's edits to those docs
/README.md merge=ours
/README.zh-CN.md merge=ours
/README.es.md merge=ours
